  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-2TO5-R8-011$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your team starts using a new process that changes how you do a routine task. The team must continue meeting normal output while adapting. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Learn the new steps and use them in your next task$qb$, $qb$Attend the training and ask questions where needed$qb$, $qb$Use both old and new methods until you feel confident$qb$, $qb$Wait to see how experienced teammates handle it$qb$, $qb$Keep using the old method because it is faster$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
