  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-2TO5-R8-013$qb$, $qb$A1-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You join a project and are unsure who owns one part of the work. Several people's work depends on clear ownership. What should you do first?$qb$, $qb$Clarify the owner before starting that part$qb$, $qb$Ask a teammate how the work is usually divided$qb$, $qb$Start the work and hand it over if needed$qb$, $qb$Wait until someone assigns the task directly$qb$, $qb$Assume the most senior person owns it$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
