  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-2TO5-R8-015$qb$, $qb$A1-04$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You receive a message that makes you angry just before a meeting. You need to make another work decision immediately afterward. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Pause, settle your reaction, and respond after checking the facts$qb$, $qb$Take a short break before deciding whether a reply is needed$qb$, $qb$Reply briefly so the issue does not stay unresolved$qb$, $qb$Tell a coworker how unreasonable the message was$qb$, $qb$Send your first response while the issue is fresh$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
