  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-10TO17-R1-012$qb$, $qb$A1-05$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your manager asks for an urgent update while you are waiting for one fact from another team. You are accountable for the outcome while several senior stakeholders are advocating incompatible priorities. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Share what is confirmed, clearly state what is pending, and give the expected update time$qb$, $qb$Give the confirmed information and mention the missing fact$qb$, $qb$Wait until the missing fact arrives before replying$qb$, $qb$Guess the missing fact so the update is complete$qb$, $qb$Say the work is delayed without explaining why$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
