  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-10TO17-R2-013$qb$, $qb$A1-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A teammate completes their part, but another person does not know the handoff is ready. Workstreams are meeting local milestones while program-level dependencies and integration risk are worsening. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Make the handoff visible to the next owner and confirm the next action$qb$, $qb$Notify the next person that the work is ready$qb$, $qb$Assume they will see the status in the system$qb$, $qb$Tell the manager the first part is complete$qb$, $qb$Wait until the next person asks$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
