  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-25PLUS-R07-016$qb$, $qb$A1-07$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$An AI system can recommend layoffs to meet cost targets using performance and role data. What governance is strongest?$qb$, $qb$Treat it as high-impact decision support with justified data, bias and error testing, explainability, human accountability, legal and employee protections, and meaningful review or appeal.$qb$, $qb$Address the largest immediate risk and defer less visible enterprise consequences until the next planning cycle.$qb$, $qb$Run a bounded pilot but leave success criteria and the next decision threshold undefined.$qb$, $qb$Ask relevant operating leaders to absorb the issue within existing authority and resources.$qb$, $qb$Choose the option that best protects current reported performance and reputation.$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
